pairs open names [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]in both directions and never writes a `\\[type::]` field.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]9[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pomodoro_names_follow_task_types.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/pomodoro_names_follow_task_types.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-hd[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-hd/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the Obsidian rename regression and the Task Card live-link[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]lookup[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-writer-bugs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-writer-bugs: in bob-navigation-hotkeys, make Pomodoro rename [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](commit and preview) retype linked tasks again, and make the Task Card [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]type, inbox route, and note-move live-link lookup search open entries [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]only, by vault path plus block ID.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared agreement rule, close settle, and Rust ledger applier[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agree-rule[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agree-rule: add the pure `agree_entry` and `settle_closed` planners, the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]MEET guard in `relocate`, new shared vector sections, and one Rust [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]applier that agrees chosen entries in a day's text through a pluggable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task-type lookup.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Type-agreement pass in bob task reconcile[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reconcile-pass[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agree-rule, plugin-writer-bugs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconcile-pass: run the applier over today's open entries after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocked-link consumption; report renames and unrepaired cases in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]additive JSON and human output; narrow and test the `type_mismatch` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lint; write the docs, decision record, and task-type glossary.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ledger Tools JS mirror, api.themes additions, and inherited [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]type marks[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger-tools-mirror[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agree-rule[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger-tools-mirror: copy the vectors, mirror `agreeEntry`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`settleClosed`, and the relocation MEET guard in JS, expose them and an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]async `agreeLedgerEntries` on api.themes, and let the type mark include [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inherited types.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob-side writers agree the entries they touch[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-writers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agree-rule[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-writers: run the applier over every entry that a capture batch, `bob[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task cancel` or `complete`, Ensure Next, or a D8 MoveTo source changes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and match `find_live_link` on path plus block ID.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close settle and new typed entries in bob[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-close-and-naming[dim] · [d